{"text":"kuruntokai","n":271,"lines":["அருவி யன்ன பருவறை சிதறி","யாறுநிறை பகரு நாடனைத் தேறி","உற்றது மன்னு மொருநாள் மற்றது","தவப்பன் னாள்தோள் மயங்கி","வௌவும் பண்பின் நோயா கின்றே"],"tr":["aruvi yaṉṉa paruvaṟai citaṟi","yāṟuniṟai pakaru nāṭaṉait tēṟi","uṟṟatu maṉṉu morunāḷ maṟṟatu","tavappaṉ ṉāḷtōḷ mayaṅki","vauvum paṇpiṉ nōyā kiṉṟē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"அழிசி நச்சாத்தனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Aḻici Naccāttaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 12, veṇṭaḷai 5, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அருவி","tr":"aruvi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரு","tr":"aru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வி","tr":"vi"}]},{"text":"யன்ன","tr":"yaṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யன்","tr":"yaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"பருவறை","tr":"paruvaṟai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பரு","tr":"paru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வறை","tr":"vaṟai"}]},{"text":"சிதறி","tr":"citaṟi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சித","tr":"cita"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றி","tr":"ṟi"}]}],[{"text":"யாறுநிறை","tr":"yāṟuniṟai","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுநி","tr":"ṟuni"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றை","tr":"ṟai"}]},{"text":"பகரு","tr":"pakaru","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பக","tr":"paka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரு","tr":"ru"}]},{"text":"நாடனைத்","tr":"nāṭaṉait","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனைத்","tr":"ṭaṉait"}]},{"text":"தேறி","tr":"tēṟi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றி","tr":"ṟi"}]}],[{"text":"உற்றது","tr":"uṟṟatu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"உற்","tr":"uṟ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றது","tr":"ṟatu"}]},{"text":"மன்னு","tr":"maṉṉu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னு","tr":"ṉu"}]},{"text":"மொருநாள்","tr":"morunāḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மொரு","tr":"moru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாள்","tr":"nāḷ"}]},{"text":"மற்றது","tr":"maṟṟatu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மற்","tr":"maṟ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றது","tr":"ṟatu"}]}],[{"text":"தவப்பன்","tr":"tavappaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தவப்","tr":"tavap"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பன்","tr":"paṉ"}]},{"text":"னாள்தோள்","tr":"ṉāḷtōḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாள்","tr":"ṉāḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோள்","tr":"tōḷ"}]},{"text":"மயங்கி","tr":"mayaṅki","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மயங்","tr":"mayaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கி","tr":"ki"}]}],[{"text":"வௌவும்","tr":"vauvum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வௌ","tr":"vau"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வும்","tr":"vum"}]},{"text":"பண்பின்","tr":"paṇpiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பண்","tr":"paṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"}]},{"text":"நோயா","tr":"nōyā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோ","tr":"nō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"கின்றே","tr":"kiṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கின்","tr":"kiṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அருவி","parts":[{"text":"அருவி","lemma":"அருவி","gloss":"waterfall"}],"gloss":"waterfall"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"பருவறை","parts":[{"text":"பரு","lemma":"பரு","gloss":"large"},{"text":"அறை","lemma":"அறை","gloss":"rock"}],"gloss":"large rock"},{"surface":"சிதறி","parts":[{"text":"சிதறி","lemma":"சிதறு","gloss":"having splashed"}],"gloss":"splashing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாறு","parts":[{"text":"யாறு","lemma":"யாறு","gloss":"river"}],"gloss":"river"},{"surface":"நிறை","parts":[{"text":"நிறை","lemma":"நிறை","gloss":"fullness"}],"gloss":"flood"},{"surface":"பகரு","parts":[{"text":"பகரு","lemma":"பகர்","gloss":"proclaiming"}],"gloss":"proclaiming"},{"surface":"நாடனை","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"he"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative marker"}],"gloss":"the man of the land"},{"surface":"தேறி","parts":[{"text":"தேறி","lemma":"தேறு","gloss":"having trusted"}],"gloss":"having trusted"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உற்றது","parts":[{"text":"உற்றது","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"that which was experienced"}],"gloss":"what was experienced"},{"surface":"மன்னும்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"ஒருநாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"one day"},{"surface":"மற்றது","parts":[{"text":"மற்று","lemma":"மற்று","gloss":"but"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"but that"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தவ","parts":[{"text":"தவ","lemma":"தவ","gloss":"greatly"}],"gloss":"greatly"},{"surface":"பல்","parts":[{"text":"பல்","lemma":"பல்","gloss":"many"}],"gloss":"many"},{"surface":"நாள்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"days"},{"surface":"தோள்","parts":[{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"தோள்","gloss":"shoulder"}],"gloss":"shoulders"},{"surface":"மயங்கி","parts":[{"text":"மயங்கி","lemma":"மயங்கு","gloss":"having embraced"}],"gloss":"embracing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வௌவும்","parts":[{"text":"வௌவும்","lemma":"வௌவு","gloss":"snatching"}],"gloss":"snatching"},{"surface":"பண்பின்","parts":[{"text":"பண்பு","lemma":"பண்பு","gloss":"nature"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the nature"},{"surface":"நோய்","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"நோய்","gloss":"affliction"}],"gloss":"affliction"},{"surface":"ஆகின்றே","parts":[{"text":"ஆகின்றே","lemma":"ஆகின்றே","gloss":"has indeed become"}],"gloss":"has indeed become","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Like a waterfall, on the large rock splashing, / the river's fullness proclaiming, the man of the land having trusted, / what was experienced was indeed for one day; but that, / for very many days, shoulders embracing, / has become an affliction of the nature of snatching.","translation":"Trusting the lord of the land where the river's flood splashes against large rocks like a waterfall, proclaiming its fullness, our union was indeed only for a single day. But now, embracing my shoulders for very many days, it has become an affliction that snatches away my life.","modern":"அருவி போலப் பெரிய பாறைகளில் மோதிச் சிதறி, ஆற்றின் வெள்ளப் பெருக்கை அறிவிக்கும் நாட்டை உடையவனை நம்பி, அவனோடு நான் அடைந்த இன்பம் ஒரு நாள் மட்டுமே. ஆனால், அந்த இன்பமானது பல நாட்கள் என் தோள்களைத் தழுவி, இப்போது என் உயிரைக் கவரும் தன்மையுடைய நோயாக மாறிவிட்டது.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her close friend (or to herself) in the Marutam (agricultural) landscape, expressing her grief over the hero's separation. She describes his land as a place where the river's abundant flood splashes against large rocks like a waterfall, announcing its arrival. This image of the roaring, splashing river symbolizes the hero's intense but fleeting passion. She laments that while their actual union lasted for only a single day, the longing and pain of separation have lingered for many days. This persistent grief has now become a consuming affliction that clings to her shoulders and slowly wastes her away.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}